<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-07-01T02:33:13.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-web-pages-c3f8bd63-84ca-4ff5-96ba-3d31a3f31846",
        "text": "Imagine building a house. Before you add paint or furniture, you need a strong frame! That's what **HTML** is for a web page – it provides the basic structure and content.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/da0c9a7c42bede1dcb0a2c3289b3992a-test-lesson-intro-web-pages-panel-1-24577340-68b6-4843-8be7-4a190b4feb3b.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-web-pages-0dd850f4-b6d0-40e1-8ca6-ba34127456a3",
        "text": "Now that you have the house's structure, you want it to look good! **CSS** (Cascading Style Sheets) is like the interior designer and exterior decorator. It adds colors, fonts, and layouts to make your web page appealing.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b18709636b0c9490b115ced71633c71f-test-lesson-intro-web-pages-panel-2-44d9f58a-1611-4738-8999-5735cf7f6a11.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-web-pages-aecd7564-157b-439a-91c7-a744bfb3c432",
        "text": "A beautiful house is great, but what if you want to open a door, turn on a light, or make things move? That's where **JavaScript** comes in! It adds interactivity and dynamic behavior to your web page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/734b31e69f8933939077e8ac4f6e440a-test-lesson-intro-web-pages-panel-3-61ec85b8-9f42-4657-bc66-739fce5f7240.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-web-pages-f60d2205-6f82-4ab7-a1ce-7f11499e8d00",
        "text": "So, HTML builds the foundation, CSS makes it look good, and JavaScript brings it to life! These three technologies work together seamlessly to create almost every web page you visit.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/32fe3e730572707a98d8f21e97b080bd-test-lesson-intro-web-pages-panel-4-092c1904-c25e-4dc4-ba11-da649c144763.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Introduce the basic components of a web page: HTML for structure, CSS for styling, and JavaScript for interactivity. Explain their roles and how they work together to create dynamic content."
  },
  "published": true,
